</article>
<article class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-way">
<h3 class="lsu-scope-world-series">Wildcard</h3>
<p class="lsu-scope-world-series">Tell us your story. Make a video, post it on Instagram with #LSU27 and tag @lastsoulultra.</p>
<p class="lsu-scope-world-series">We watch every single one. If it’s a story we want to tell, you’re in.</p>
