</a>
</li>
<li class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-race">
<a class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-window" data-window="lsu-2027-uk">
<span class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-date">Opens 1 Nov 2026</span>
<h3 class="lsu-scope-world-series">United Kingdom</h3>
<span class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-fine">Closes 1 Jan 2027</span>
<span class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-window-cta">Request a race entry →</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-race">
<a class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-window" data-window="lsu-2027-aus">
