</div>
<h2 id="qualify-title" class="lsu-scope-world-series">How to qualify</h2>
<p class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-intro">Earn your place on the Finals start line.</p>
<div class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-places" aria-label="Top 15 overall and top 5 women from each qualifying race">
<div class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-place">
