</span>
</div>
</div>
<p class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-per-race">From each race below. <span class="lsu-scope-world-series">Overlaps count once. Ties can add qualifiers.</span>
</p>
<div class="lsu-scope-world-series ws-race-label">The four qualifying races</div>
